# NOTE: data/generated/ (pre-generated hero ad images) IS committed on purpose —
# the app serves them via /data and scripts/deploy.sh bundles them, so the repo
# stays self-contained and deployable from a fresh clone. New runtime images on
# Lambda use DIRECT mode (no writes), so nothing un-tracked accumulates here.
